## Output Template — EXPANDED
(Append after the last regular section, continuing sequential numbering.)

```

X. **Timeline**
- <Start UTC / End UTC / Event> (Local: <start / end>)

X. **Root Cause Analysis**
- …

X. **Escalation History**
- <Who / When / To which team or owner>

X. **Next Actions & Owners**
- <Action — Owner — Target date>

```

**Note:** X represents the next sequential section number after the regular sections.

